xt":"实际操作","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7b4d8272-79bb-4fef-814b-fe5fcec189c3","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"21450db9-4081-4c84-a561-96be9ea2f96b","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_adc57068-02ce-4855-9bca-2fa70baf74c4.png"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d94ebb6e-4680-446f-846f-10e2aa62cd17","tauContract":"e43f9dce629c905e0bcd68c62f974061860b4a4428d1bf3ee0965ca60e23efd0","type":"divide-line"},{"children":[{"text":"在光栅化里面是怎么生产阴影的，Shadow mapping!","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b5b7bb3a-b113-4fa6-8af9-1b814025eccd","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6ee05420-b4d1-4579-b6a0-1c8471851042","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_3947cefb-b11f-4b23-8ab3-4b25dd249bfc.png"},{"children":[{"text":"用了 Shadow Mapping，在生成阴影时是不需要知道几何信息的，问题是会产生走样现象。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"15e669c2-6129-46f8-89a1-b89ffa1e8715","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"最重要的思想就是，点不在阴影里，又能看到这个点，说明可以在摄像机看到这个点，并且光源也可以看到这个点，如果在阴影里，你看的到这个点，但是光看不到这个点。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"58cc5a8f-e47f-4927-9601-8bdc97ea34f5","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"628e9d16-ebee-42e5-8d6e-7de988343a07","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c95